    {
      "id": "b1.g14.l2", "title": "zich, zelf and elkaar", "kind": "grammar",
      "explain": [
        { "type": "p", "text": "A **reflexive pronoun** is used when the subject and the object are the **same person**: *Ik was **me**. Hij wast **zich**.* Compare *Hij wast **hem*** (he washes another person). The forms are **me, je, zich, ons, je, zich**. With **-zelf** the pronoun is emphasised: *mezelf, jezelf, zichzelf, onszelf*: *Ik help **mezelf**.* The separate word **zelf** means *by oneself*: *Ik doe het **zelf**.*" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "**Elkaar** means *each other*: *Zij kennen **elkaar**. Wij zien **elkaar** morgen.* With a preposition: *Zij houden van **elkaar**.* Do not use *zich* for *each other*." },
        { "type": "table", "head": ["person", "reflexive", "example"], "rows": [["ik", "me / mezelf", "Ik was me."], ["jij", "je / jezelf", "Jij wast je."], ["hij / zij", "zich / zichzelf", "Hij wast zich."], ["wij", "ons / onszelf", "Wij wassen ons."], ["zij (they)", "zich / zichzelf", "Zij wassen zich."], ["each other", "elkaar", "Zij kennen elkaar."]] },
        { "type": "ex", "nl": "Zij voelt zich niet goed.", "en": "She does not feel well." },
        { "type": "ex", "nl": "Wij zien elkaar morgen.", "en": "We will see each other tomorrow." },
        { "type": "tip", "text": "*Zelf* does not change: *Ik doe het zelf. Hij doet het zelf. Zij doen het zelf.*" }
      ],
      "items": [
        { "type": "choice", "q": "Hij wast ___. (himself)", "options": ["zich", "hem", "elkaar"], "answer": 0 },
        { "type": "choice", "q": "Wij herinneren ___ de reis.", "options": ["ons", "zich", "elkaar"], "answer": 0 },
        { "type": "choice", "q": "Zij kennen ___ al lang. (each other)", "options": ["elkaar", "zich", "zichzelf"], "answer": 0 },
        { "type": "choice", "q": "Ik doe het ___. (by myself)", "options": ["zelf", "mezelf", "me"], "answer": 0 },
        { "type": "choice", "q": "Zij houden veel van ___. (each other)", "options": ["elkaar", "zich", "hen"], "answer": 0 },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Ik was ___. (reflexive)", "answers": ["me", "mezelf"], "en": "I wash myself." },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Zij voelt ___ ziek.", "answers": ["zich"], "en": "She feels ill." },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Wij zien ___ morgen. (each other)", "answers": ["elkaar"], "en": "We will see each other tomorrow." },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Hij heeft het ___ gedaan. (by himself)", "answers": ["zelf"], "en": "He has done it himself." },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Jij moet ___ haasten.", "answers": ["je"], "en": "You must hurry." },
        { "type": "gap", "text": "Ik vraag ___ af of hij komt.", "answers": ["me", "mij"], "en": "I wonder whether he is coming." },
        { "type": "transform", "q": "Zij kent Jan. Jan kent haar.", "instruction": "Combine with elkaar: Zij kennen ...", "answers": ["Zij kennen elkaar"] },
        { "type": "transform", "q": "Ik doe het.", "instruction": "Add zelf: Ik doe het ...", "answers": ["Ik doe het zelf"] },
        { "type": "transform", "q": "Zij wast het kind.", "instruction": "Now she washes herself: Zij wast ...", "answers": ["Zij wast zich"] },
        { "type": "transform", "q": "Jan ziet Els. Els ziet Jan.", "instruction": "Use elkaar: Jan en Els zien ...", "answers": ["Jan en Els zien elkaar"] },
        { "type": "order", "answer": "Hij wast zich.", "en": "He washes himself." },
        { "type": "order", "answer": "Wij zien elkaar morgen.", "alt": ["Morgen zien wij elkaar."], "en": "We will see each other tomorrow." },
        { "type": "order", "answer": "Zij houden veel van elkaar.", "en": "They love each other very much." },
        { "type": "order", "answer": "Ik doe het zelf.", "en": "I will do it myself." },
        { "type": "translate", "en": "She feels ill.", "answers": ["Zij voelt zich ziek", "Ze voelt zich ziek"] },
        { "type": "translate", "en": "We see each other tomorrow.", "answers": ["Wij zien elkaar morgen", "We zien elkaar morgen", "Morgen zien wij elkaar", "Morgen zien we elkaar"] },
        { "type": "translate", "en": "I will do it myself.", "answers": ["Ik doe het zelf", "Ik zal het zelf doen", "Ik ga het zelf doen"] },
        { "type": "match", "pairs": [["zich", "he / she / they (reflexive)"], ["ons", "we (reflexive)"], ["elkaar", "each other"], ["zelf", "emphasis: by oneself"]] }
      ],
      "sources": [
